{
  "name": "Defensive Duelist",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Parry.</strong> If you’re holding a Finesse weapon and another creature hits you with a melee attack, you can take a Reaction to add your Proficiency Bonus (currently, [[lookup @prof]]) to your Armor Class, potentially causing the attack to miss you. You gain this bonus to your AC against melee attacks until the start of your next turn.</p><section id=\"secret-En8YXJoQaVQXOweT\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which will increase your Armor Class.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
